DOC=GIB THE OWNED BUILD DIRECTORIES MAY HOLD TOGETHER (sp-ke0uk8). Over it, a new lease deletes IDLE directories until under, from the repository holding the most of them, least recently used first; no repository's last one goes while any repository holds two. A live one is counted but never trimmed or deleted. Deleted folders still waiting to be reaped count only once a finished reap has left them.
SCHEMA=GiB all owned build directories under dwarf_build_base may hold; over it idle ones are deleted, from the repository holding the most, least recently used first; live ones never. Bytes waiting to be reaped count only once a finished reap has left them (unset: 60).
DEFAULT<<'SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF'
    # GIB THE OWNED BUILD DIRECTORIES MAY HOLD TOGETHER (sp-ke0uk8). Each is one workspace
    # target (tens of GiB). Past this, a new lease deletes idle directories, from the repository
    # holding the most; a live directory is never trimmed or deleted, so live sessions may exceed it.
    : "${SPIRA_DWARF_BUILD_BUDGET_GIB:=60}"
SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF
